{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49377","headline":"摊破浣溪沙 · 毛文锡","name":"摊破浣溪沙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春水轻波浸绿苔，枇杷洲上紫檀开。\n晴日眠沙鸂鶒稳，暖相偎。\n罗韈生尘游女过，有人逢着弄珠回。\n兰麝飘香初解佩，忘归来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"毛文锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49377.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49377","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}